    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Efforts to integrate private providers for boosting routine childhood vaccination in Karachi's low-income areas are set to receive a much-needed shot in the arm as a memorandum of understanding, signed by the Sindh Department of Health and the Aga Khan University goes into effect.",
